/div></div><nav class="dropdown-list in-nav simple w-dropdown-list"><a href="/free-business-plan-review" title="Get a free business plan expert review" class="navigation-item in-drop primary-templates w-nav-link">Free Business Plan Review</a><a href="/consulting-services/business-plan-writing-service" title="Expert business plan writing service" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">Business Plan Writing Service</a><a href="/business-plan-templates" title="Brows free DIY business plan templates" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">Free Business Plan Templates</a></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="w-dropdown"><div class="navigation-item w drop w-dropdown-toggle"><div title="SBA Loan Tools &amp; Services">SBA Loans</div><div class="icon-10 w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list in-nav simple w-dropdown-list"><a href="/free-sba-review" title="Get a free expert SBA review" class="navigation-item in-drop primary-templates w-nav-link">Free SBA Expert Review</a><a href="/consulting-services/sba-prequalification-service" title="SBA Concierge guidance service" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">SBA Pre-Qualification</a><a href="https://www.projectionhub.com/data/sba-lender-finder" title="Free lender finder interactive tool" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">Free SBA Lender Finder Tool</a><a href="https://www.projectionhub.com/resources/sba-loan-checklist?srsltid=AfmBOorgdIf0_XFhDergqbBwI6CxpnudoePzL1dbqgfzH5cpyMLjddqM" title="Download a free SBA application checklist" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">Free SBA Checklist</a></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="w-dropdown"><div class="navigation-item w drop w-dropdown-toggle"><div title="Acquisition Tools &amp; Services">Acquisitions</div><div class="icon-10 w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list in-nav simple w-dropdown-list"><a href="/free-sba-review" title="Get a free SBA expert review" class="navigation-item in-drop primary-templates w-nav-link">Free SBA Review</a><a href="/consulting-services/qoe-sniff-test" title="Quality of Earnings Sniif Test Service" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">QofE &quot;Sniff Test&quot; Service</a><a href="https://www.projectionhub.com/financial-projection-template/acquisition" title="DIY Excel Financial Projection Templates" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">DIY Projection Template</a><a href="https://www.projectionhub.com/resources/valuation-calculator" title="Download a Free valuation calculator" class="navigation-item in-drop secondary primary-template w-nav-link">Free Valuation Calculator</a></nav></div><a href="/pricing" title="Excel Financial Projection Templates Pricing" class="navigation-item w w-nav-link">Pricing</a><a title="ProjectionHub Login" href="https://app.projectionhub.com/home/log_in" class="button _16px-margin-rigth outline y mt-20 w-button">Log In</a><a title="View Excel Financial Projection Templates" href="/financial-projection-excel-templates" class="link-arrow y w-inline-block w-clearfix"><div class="text-block-132">View Templates</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/61799f55e5c79a0e0fe57329_chevron-right.svg" alt="Right Chevron" class="arrow"/></a></nav><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="menu-button-wrapper"><div class="menu-button-line"></div><div class="menu-button-line"></div><div class="menu-button-line"></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="hero-heading-left-5"><div class="container-37"><div class="hero-wrapper-5"><div class="hero-split-5"><h1 class="h1">Custom Boutique Market Research Report</h1><p class="paragraph top-margin-20 margin-bottom-30">Our Expertly-curated Boutique Market Research Reports Provide Exclusive Insights to Help You Comprehend Your Local Market, Outwit the Competition, and Implement Knowledge-driven Business Strategies.</p><a href="#pricing" class="button w-button">Get Started</a></div><div class="hero-split-5"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report.png 700w" alt="" class="shadow-two-6"/></div></div></div></section><section class="solution-section"><div class="container-38"><h2 class="h2-pricing-page">Unraveling Your Local Boutique Landscape Can Be Daunting...We&#x27;re Here to Assist</h2><p class="headersubheading-2">From understanding your local boutique market dynamics to making strategic decisions on inventory, our Boutique Market Research Report is your secret weapon to confidently overcome these challenges.</p><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="team-slider-wrapper-3 w-slider" data-autoplay="true" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="true" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="12" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="w-slider-mask"><div class="team-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="team-block-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d1cd274ba2d8498c2ff_confrontation.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d1cd274ba2d8498c2ff_confrontation-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d1cd274ba2d8498c2ff_confrontation.png 512w" alt="" class="team-member-image-two-3"/><div class="team-block-info-3"><h3 class="team-member-name-two-3"><strong>Understand Your Competition</strong></h3><p class="team-member-text-3">Gain in-depth insights into your competitors including keyword rankings and estimated foot traffic to their boutique locations.</p></div></div></div><div class="team-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="team-block-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d24166d88430fffaf8a_map%20(2).png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d24166d88430fffaf8a_map%20(2)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64628d24166d88430fffaf8a_map%20(2).png 512w" alt="" class="team-member-image-two-3"/><div class="team-block-info-3"><h3 class="team-member-name-two-3"><strong>Select the Perfect Location</strong></h3><p class="team-member-text-3">Receive comprehensive demographic data, customer heatmaps, and foot traffic estimates to identify the most promising location for your boutique.</p></div></div></div><div class="team-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="team-block-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a47c35c0295ca225cb8d8_demand.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a47c35c0295ca225cb8d8_demand-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a47c35c0295ca225cb8d8_demand.png 512w" alt="" class="team-member-image-two-3"/><div class="team-block-info-3"><h3 class="team-member-name-two-3"><strong>Recognize Market  Trends</strong></h3><p class="team-member-text-3">Stay ahead of the curve by understanding seasonal trends, keyword search volume, and advertising rates specific to your industry.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="team-slider-arrow-3 w-slider-arrow-left"><div class="w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="team-slider-arrow-3 w-slider-arrow-right"><div class="w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="team-slider-nav-3 w-slider-nav"></div></div></div></section><section class="solution-benefits"><div class="container-40"><h2 class="centered-heading-5">Our Boutique Market Research Report is a game-changer for boutique businesses</h2><p class="centered-subheading-5">Whether you&#x27;re launching a new venture or looking to grow an existing one, our report equips you with the precise knowledge you need to make confident, data-driven decisions.</p><div class="team-grid"><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23df5-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f742fc3ddabd2515781_keyword%20(1).png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f742fc3ddabd2515781_keyword%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f742fc3ddabd2515781_keyword%20(1).png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Keyword Research</div><p class="problem-description"> Analysis of top-performing trends for your boutique industry.</p></div><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23e00-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f79cd93c0cf21ccc803_ads.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f79cd93c0cf21ccc803_ads-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f79cd93c0cf21ccc803_ads.png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Advertising Costs</div><p class="problem-description">Digital advertising costs in your specific market.</p></div><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23e0a-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f7dd44795fb3931569c_market-research%20(1).png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f7dd44795fb3931569c_market-research%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f7dd44795fb3931569c_market-research%20(1).png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Market Demand Trends</div><p class="problem-description">Crucial data on market demand and your industry trends.</p></div><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23e14-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f8d77f124fb7d416098_competition%20(2).png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f8d77f124fb7d416098_competition%20(2)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628f8d77f124fb7d416098_competition%20(2).png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Competitor Analysis</div><p class="problem-description">An in-depth examination of your selected competitors.</p></div><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23e1e-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628fecba6705db8e380145_gps.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628fecba6705db8e380145_gps-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628fecba6705db8e380145_gps.png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Site Location Analysis</div><p class="problem-description">Detailed heatmaps of customer locations and estimated foot traffic.</p></div><div id="w-node-fbe8951f-8e2e-f174-abf7-ef44bad23e28-8d8da7b3" class="team-card"><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628ff1a57eeae14be109b0_diagram.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628ff1a57eeae14be109b0_diagram-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd804279321d5de64a8a3/64628ff1a57eeae14be109b0_diagram.png 512w" class="benefit-icon"/><div class="market-research-feature">Demographic Breakdown</div><p class="problem-description">Get a summary of the local population and relevant demographic data.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="gallery-overview-2"><div class="container-39"><div class="gallery-wrapper-4"><div id="w-node-_88b6ade3-1bef-2029-d76b-6ce3b79f8513-8d8da7b3" class="gallery-block-4"><h2 class="heading-93">What&#x27;s Included?</h2><p class="paragraph-25">Our team prepares a custom report complete with the following data for your business:</p><div class="gallery-features-block-2"><ul role="list" class="list-4 included w-list-unstyled"><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Foot Traffic Analysis for your Target Location</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Foot Traffic for 2 Competitor locations</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Sq Footage of Target Location &amp; Competitors</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Avg Annual Sales for Eligible Target Locations &amp; eligible Competitors</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Target Location Traffic Trend Graph</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Target Keyword Research, Trends, &amp; Competitor Keyword Analysis</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Local Demographic Summary of Target Location</div></li></ul></div><a href="#pricing" class="button w-button">Get Started</a></div><div id="w-node-_88b6ade3-1bef-2029-d76b-6ce3b79f852b-8d8da7b3" class="gallery-grid-2"><div id="w-node-_88b6ade3-1bef-2029-d76b-6ce3b79f852c-8d8da7b3" class="html-embed-15 w-embed w-iframe"><iframe src="https://23264651.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/23264651/Market%20Research%20Report%20-%20Boutique-1.pdf" width="100%" height="600">
  <p>Your browser does not support PDFs. <a href="https://23264651.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/23264651/Market%20Research%20Report%20-%20Boutique-1.pdf">Download the PDF</a> instead.</p>
</iframe></div></div></div></div></section><section class="gallery-slider-3"><div class="container-38"><div class="gallery-wrapper-3"><div id="w-node-_086a6636-2468-576a-7492-4d3174b71f67-8d8da7b3" class="gallery-block-3"><h3 class="heading-92">How it Works</h3><p class="paragraph">Through our partnership with <a href="https://advanresearch.com/" target="_blank">Advan</a> using their powerful technology, we can pull estimated traffic data to nearly any building in the United States and Canada. Market research reports are delivered within 2 business days from the time of submission!</p></div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="gallery-slide-3 w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="true" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true" id="w-node-_086a6636-2468-576a-7492-4d3174b71f6f-8d8da7b3"><div class="w-slider-mask"><div class="gallery-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="gallery-slide-image-3"><img id="w-node-_086a6636-2468-576a-7492-4d3174b71f73-8d8da7b3" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a80d87384c7911da4c0d3_yellow%20backgroundAsset%203.png" loading="lazy" class="gallery-image-3"/><h3 class="gallery-slide-text-3">1) After checkout, you will immediately receive a report order form</h3></div></div><div class="gallery-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="gallery-slide-image-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a80eec5c56538164a7fb2_blue%20backgroundAsset%204.png" class="gallery-image-3"/><h3 class="gallery-slide-text-3">2) You will answer a few questions and provide the target locations&#x27; addresses</h3></div></div><div class="gallery-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="gallery-slide-image-3"><img id="w-node-_086a6636-2468-576a-7492-4d3174b71f7d-8d8da7b3" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a81029219a372b52e516b_purple%20backgroundAsset%205.png" loading="lazy" class="gallery-image-3"/><h3 class="gallery-slide-text-3">3) Our team takes your information to collect and compile the market research report</h3></div></div><div class="gallery-slide-wrapper-3 w-slide"><div class="gallery-slide-image-3"><img id="w-node-_086a6636-2468-576a-7492-4d3174b71f82-8d8da7b3" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645a8113ccb04e231244d6ae_light%20blue%20backgroundAsset%206.png" loading="lazy" class="gallery-image-3"/><h3 class="gallery-slide-text-3">4) We follow up with your custom report and a custom video walkthrough!</h3></div></div></div><div class="gallery-slider-left-3 w-slider-arrow-left"><div class="arrow-wrapper-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62434fa732124a0fb112aab4/62434fa732124a0e4912aadb_Chevron%20right-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="slider-arrow-embed-3"/></div></div><div class="gallery-slider-right-3 w-slider-arrow-right"><div class="arrow-wrapper-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62434fa732124a0fb112aab4/62434fa732124a7ce212aacc_Chevron%20right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="slider-arrow-embed-3"/></div></div><div class="gallery-slide-nav-3 w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="hero-heading-left-7"><div class="container-44"><div class="hero-wrapper-7"><div class="hero-split-7"><h3 class="heading-95">See it in Action</h3><p class="margin-bottom-24px-9">Watch as Adam demonstrates how the reports are made and what is included!</p><p class="margin-bottom-24px-9 no-video w-dyn-bind-empty"></p><div style="padding-top:56.20608899297424%" class="w-video w-embed"><iframe class="embedly-embed" src="//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2F1iKCQZEb0eg%3Ffeature%3Doembed&display_name=YouTube&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D1iKCQZEb0eg&image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F1iKCQZEb0eg%2Fhqdefault.jpg&key=96f1f04c5f4143bcb0f2e68c87d65feb&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=youtube" width="854" height="480" scrolling="no" title="YouTube embed" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe></div><a href="#pricing" class="button w-button">Get Started</a></div></div></div></section><section class="team-circles"><div class="container-42 market-research-reports"><h2 class="centered-heading-7">Why Us?</h2><p class="centered-subheading-7">ProjectionHub has a proud history of helping more than 50,000 businesses across various industries to craft accurate financial projections. This process includes understanding industry-specific and demographic assumptions to calculate realistic forecasts.<br/><br/>ProjectionHub has also formed a partnership with Advan Research to gain access to powerful foot traffic data for nearly any physical location in the United States and Canada. With their technology and our experience related to understanding various industry assumptions, you can trust your market research report will be powerful and insightful!</p><div class="team-grid-2"><div id="w-node-_3f0ab67d-24f9-47f4-3ae1-d52d4aead56a-8d8da7b3" class="team-card-2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94f2f0aac256ff16c0ea2_Adam%20circle.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 940px) 100vw, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94f2f0aac256ff16c0ea2_Adam%20circle-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94f2f0aac256ff16c0ea2_Adam%20circle-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94f2f0aac256ff16c0ea2_Adam%20circle.png 940w" alt="" class="team-member-image"/><div class="team-member-name">Adam Hoeksema</div><div class="team-member-position-2"><strong class="bold-text-40">Co Founder<br/></strong>In addition to helping tens of thousands of businesses create financial projections, Adam also served as executive director for more than a decade at an SBA Microlender &amp; CDFI where he helped small businesses apply and get approved for business loans by reviewing their financials and business plans.</div></div><div id="w-node-_3f0ab67d-24f9-47f4-3ae1-d52d4aead575-8d8da7b3" class="team-card-2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94e1623f6b9748972f20b_hotel%20circle.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 940px) 100vw, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94e1623f6b9748972f20b_hotel%20circle-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94e1623f6b9748972f20b_hotel%20circle-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/62d94e1623f6b9748972f20b_hotel%20circle.png 940w" alt="" class="team-member-image"/><div class="team-member-name">Grace Cisna</div><div class="team-member-position-2"><strong>Lead Financial Modeler<br/></strong>Grace served as an auditor for a public accounting firm auditing many different industry business plans and working on many financial models before joining ProjectionHub. With projectionHub she has build hundreds of custom financial models and hundreds of industry financial projection templates which have been used by thousands of businenesses</div></div></div></div></section><section class="pricing-comparison-2"><div class="container-38"><div class="pricing-wrapper-2 market-research-reports"><div id="pricing" class="pricing-card-2 featured-pricing w-node-_2412a34d-0fd7-082c-7d73-774968e3b3c9-8d8da7b3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/645e53c887ab9a075ff8f085_foot%20traffic%20data%20reportMarket%20Research%20Report.png 700w" alt="" class="pricing-image-3"/><h2 class="pricing-title-2 market-research-reports">Boutique Market Research Report</h2><div class="pricing-price-2">$499</div><div class="paragraph-regular-2 margin-bottom-20">Your custom market research report will be delivered <strong class="bold-text-42">within 2 business days of purchase</strong>.<br/><strong class="bold-text-41">*Only Available in the United States &amp; Canada<br/><br/>Submit your information and our team will reach out to discuss and finalize your project!<br/></strong></div><a href="https://share.hsforms.com/1uVTqwJTpQC6gFgcqs_iNBAdun4b" target="_blank" class="button w-button">Get Started</a><ul role="list" class="list-4 included price-card w-list-unstyled"><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Foot Traffic Analysis for your Target Location</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Foot Traffic for 2 Competitor locations</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Sq Footage of Target Location &amp; Competitors</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Avg Annual Sales for Eligible Target Locations &amp; eligible Competitors</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Target Location Traffic Trend Graph</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Target Keyword Research, Trends, &amp; Competitor Keyword Analysis</div><div class="pricing-feature-2">Local Demographic Summary of Target Location</div></li></ul></div><div class="pricing-wrapper-2"><div id="Quote-form" class="pricing-card-2 featured-pricing mr-products w-node-_86f19f2b-eeab-b27a-9f01-e15ec5ea070e-8d8da7b3"><h4 class="heading-99">Foot Traffic Only</h4><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e5fd80427932172e564a883/64595eca3c34592e827ad893_location%20(2).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="pricing-image-3"/><h2 class="pricing-title-2 market-report-2">Foot Traffic Report</h2><div class="pricing-price-2">$99 per location</div><div class="paragraph-regular-2 margin-bottom-20"><span class="text-span-63">‍</span>Custom foot traffic report(s) are typically delivered <strong class="bold-text-43">within 1 business day of purchase</strong>.<br/><strong>*Only Available in the United States &amp; Canada<br/><br/>Submit your information and our team will reach out to discuss and finalize your project!<br/></strong></div><a href="https://share.hsforms.com/1bpZCwIOqR4icHJ6IJ7N88wdun4b" target="_blank" class="button w-button">Get Started</a><div class="text-block-113"><a href="/consulting-services/foot-traffic-data-report"><span class="text-span-64">Learn More Here</span></a></div><ul role="list" class="list-4 w-list-unstyled"><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Location Estimated Foot Traffic Analysis</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">5 Years of Traffic Estimate by Month</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Sq Footage of Target Location(s)</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Estimated Avg Annual Sales for Eligible Target Locations</div></li><li><div class="pricing-feature-2">Target Location(s) Traffic Trend Graph</div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><div class="w-container"><div class="wrapper-width-860px"><h2 class="heading-blue market-research">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="wrapper-width-860px"><div class="cta-text-2 w"></div><div class="faq_question-wrap"><a href="#" class="faq-question-bar-grey w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-137">What kind of information do I need to provide for the report?</div><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animation" data-w-id="844dd458-ee70-ec48-b17a-0ac5f17c24ba" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e3833917605e0671c029a3d/5e3833927605e00c4f029a54_animation-w1024-h1024%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="3.036369579362504" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="12"></div></a><div class="faq_content"><p class="p-faq-answer-faq-page">You&#x27;ll need to provide specifics about your boutique, your target market, and the competitors you&#x27;d like us to study. The more precise you are, the more personalized and advantageous your report will be. Our team will guide you through the data collection process to ensure we have all we need.</p></div></div><div class="faq_question-wrap"><a href="#" class="faq-question-bar-grey w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-137">How is trend analysis relevant to my boutique business?</div><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animation" data-w-id="844dd458-ee70-ec48-b17a-0ac5f17c2569" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e3833917605e0671c029a3d/5e3833927605e00c4f029a54_animation-w1024-h1024%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="3.036369579362504" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="12"></div></a><div class="faq_content"><p class="p-faq-answer-faq-page">Trend analysis is key to understanding what potential customers are looking for in boutiques like yours. This information can guide your inventory selection, online presence, and promotional strategies. It&#x27;s a critical part of understanding and reaching your target customers.</p></div></div><div class="faq_question-wrap"><a href="#" class="faq-question-bar-grey w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-137">What if my boutique operates in a niche market?</div><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animation" data-w-id="844dd458-ee70-ec48-b17a-0ac5f17c2571" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e3833917605e0671c029a3d/5e3833927605e00c4f029a54_animation-w1024-h1024%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="3.036369579362504" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="12"></div></a><div class="faq_content"><p class="p-faq-answer-faq-page">Our team has experience in conducting market research across diverse niches. Irrespective of your boutique&#x27;s uniqueness, we&#x27;ll deliver a report that&#x27;s tailored to your specific needs and provides actionable insights for your business.</p></div></div><div class="faq_question-wrap"><a href="#" class="faq-question-bar-grey w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-137">What does &quot;target location&quot; mean in the boutique market research report?</div><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="animation" data-w-id="844dd458-ee70-ec48-b17a-0ac5f17c2579" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5e3833917605e0671c029a3d/5e3833927605e00c4f029a54_animation-w1024-h1024%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="3.036369579362504" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="12"></div></a><div class="faq_content"><p class="p-faq-answer-faq-page">The purpose of the target location is dependent on the primary purpose of the research report and the customers unique situation. For example, if you are an established business, you may not care to know the foot traffic data to the building you are already located in. Or if you are looking for a potential site to open with or move to, it would not be helpful to know the foot traffic data of that location if it had been a different type of business or vacant before. The target location can be a competitor, comparable business, nearby business to a target location, nearby mall, nearby attraction, etc.</p></div></div><div class="cta-text-2 faq"><div class="spacer"></div><h3>Need help with anything?<br/></h3><p class="paragraph-large">We&#x27;re here to help with any questions you have about plans, <br/>pricing, and supported features.</p><div class="spacer"></div><a href="/contact" class="button cc-jumbo-button blue w-inline-block"><div>Contact us</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="section footer blue"><div><div class="w-con